{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Balaspire </strong>is a roguelike where\u00a0<i>spell-card casting</i><strong> </strong>and <i>card-matching combos </i>go hand in hand to create a strategic deckbuilder roguelite! Throw out cards to cast powerful spells, and then form hand-combos of matching cards to hit your enemies hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1753197092\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match up elements and runes to rack up bigger numbers when you attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/6bddfa48d76fd2c9ec0b4f107e9bad4a.poster.avif?t=1753197092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/6bddfa48d76fd2c9ec0b4f107e9bad4a.webm?t=1753197092\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/6bddfa48d76fd2c9ec0b4f107e9bad4a.mp4?t=1753197092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1753197092\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matching-combos aren\u2019t the only way to hit hard \u2013 fill your deck with spells and discover trinkets that synergise with your strategy to grow your power exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/39c8f64ed40d1b0ae3e83f1916c6fe39.poster.avif?t=1753197092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/39c8f64ed40d1b0ae3e83f1916c6fe39.webm?t=1753197092\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/39c8f64ed40d1b0ae3e83f1916c6fe39.mp4?t=1753197092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1753197092\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend down the <i>Balaspire</i> \u2013 a mysterious subterranean tower where the deeper you go, the stranger things become\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1753197092\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has a focus on different strategies for you to explore as you make your runs down into the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/8d347cf7b182764174432f239071f478.poster.avif?t=1753197092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/8d347cf7b182764174432f239071f478.webm?t=1753197092\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667470/extras/8d347cf7b182764174432f239071f478.mp4?t=1753197092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667470?t=1753197092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667470